# Linux Backports Fragment
# TEAM_001: Configs for backported features from newer kernels
#
# This fragment is for testing kernel features backported from newer Linux versions
# to the 6.1 kernel used by Pixel 6.
#
# Workflow:
#   1. Add configs to linux_backports.aspirations
#   2. Test incrementally by adding to this fragment
#   3. Update linux_backports.last_working after each successful boot
